  "originalsAllMatch": true,
  "positiveDesignElements": [
    "明确去掉validating预提交与catch重复flush，暂存完成会话/新附件/links/audit单次store.flush，可以修53的多次提交与失败CREATE重放。",
    "Session FOR UPDATE/CAS/status→有序组锁/head CAS→撤旧latest/final→CREATE的方向可修唯一索引顺序；同事务不削弱unique，不以SQL造版本。",
    "把相关metadata/flag/link/session-create业务变更并到已有audit Option一次flush，以及abort终态commit后remove，均是必要方向。",
    "保留旧active/final直到显式markFinal；nonfinal新版本不应破坏D已冻结final材料。",
    "两文件范围能够容纳必要的session/object协调及关联集锁内重验，不必先修改Database/HTTP/DTO/DDL；但当前54未写清这两个关键条件。"
  ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "K54-P1-01",
      "priority": "P1",
      "type": "proposal-required-object-race-omission",
      "title": "只在flush锁session不能阻止已在途proxy PUT覆写已完成对象",
      "location": {
        "file": "apps/poms-api-rust/src/attachments/service.rs",
        "startLine": 703,
        "endLine": 732
      },
      "evidence": [
        "proxy_object先load/can_receive，再计算可选checksum，727–729覆盖storage key，732才调用save/flush。",
        "CreateAttachmentUploadSessionRequest.checksumSha256是optional；并发PUT可以各自从尚无checksum的合法非终态快照开始。",
        "local_put(local.rs:80)使用tokio::fs::write覆盖原key；新active Attachment service901直接复用upload session provider/bucket/key。",
        "proposal54仅明确complete先验证对象、随后事务Session FOR UPDATE；其他session的锁若仍晚于proxy实际I/O，DB CAS失败也不能回滚文件覆盖。"
      ],
      "counterexample": [
        "合法session S，checksum为空、固定size。PUT-B读取S旧v1/nonterminal/checksum=None，已计算同size内容B的SHA，暂停在对象write前。",
        "PUT-A以同一旧状态上传内容A并提交S uploaded/shaA；complete验证A并按54单事务提交active Attachment shaA，Attachment沿用S原key。",
        "PUT-B恢复，把同key真实内容覆成B；最后flush锁到S已completed、CAS拒绝/409，但文件B已存在。active记录仍宣称shaA，D/K材料hash和下载字节已不一致。",
        "类似地abort可以先提交并remove，随后已在途PUT再创建aborted key；单纯把abort remove放到commit后并未覆盖该在途I/O。"
      ],
      "mustFreeze": "在服务/store两文件内明确所有对象写入者（尤其proxy PUT）与complete/abort的协调或不可变对象绑定。可选择跨实际PUT/终态判断/complete字节校验的同session排他协议，或将校验过的字节绑定到不可再被staging PUT覆盖的最终对象。不能在文件已改后只靠DB CAS；对象校验必须基于稳定窗口的真实字节而非仅HEAD size/declared checksum。",
      "observedRuntime": false,
      "proofClass": "source-backed legal concurrent interleaving; not a new runtime result"
    },
    {
      "id": "K54-P2-02",
      "priority": "P2",
      "type": "proposal-source-binding-needs-explicit-link-recheck",
      "title": "HeadCAS不覆盖锁前读取的active link集合",
      "location": {
        "file": "apps/poms-api-rust/src/attachments/service.rs",
        "startLine": 854,
        "endLine": 858
      },
      "evidence": [
        "create_from_session先读取latest及links，再按这些旧links暂存copied links。",
        "Link是非versioned表；link/unlink改变关联状态/集合，不必改变Attachment.row_version。",
        "仅“版本组锁+head CAS”不能证明暂存的来源active links仍是锁内真实集合。"
      ],
      "counterexample": [
        "complete读取head A/version v及active link L，尚未取得组锁。",
        "link/unlink在其事务先提交active关联变更，head A.row_version仍v。",
        "complete取得组锁且head CAS通过，仍从旧L创建新附件的关联，可能复制已解除关联，或遗漏新实际关联。"
      ],
      "mustFreeze": "所有相关写者使用同一组锁协议；complete锁内重读并比较完整active link集合/身份/status/target/relation，或锁内从真实集合生成copied links。若预构造集合已变必须409并恢复context；不要仅以head.row_version把关联集当未变。",
      "observedRuntime": false,
      "proofClass": "source binding omission; exact locked revalidation rule required before implementation admission"
    }
  ],
  "mandatoryPassConditions": [
    "先冻结上述对象I/O协议和锁内active-link集验证，再给作者准入；不得用“store里会锁”代替proxy写前的终态保护。",
    "presigned-put已签发的外部PUT不能受本进程DB row lock约束。若声明该模式也安全，必须说明不可变final对象/version或可证不可覆盖的绑定；当前local K结果不可外推该模式。",
    "若锁跨storage I/O，要避免在占用唯一连接时再调用另取连接的storage runtime config查询；在两文件内明确可行边界，不能引入自等待连接池。",
    "early-release字段只能在同事务撤位，early保存实体不得再在ordinary UPDATE二次重复写/CAS；当前actor/权限、source head、status/expiry等业务条件均须锁内一致。",
    "失败恢复entities、raw/json baselines与pending-auth；commit未知时不得盲重放或删除可能已生效对象。成功后才发布身份map结果。",
    "实际验收须加入checksum省略的两个PUT与complete/abort交错、stale PUT不能覆写completed对象、lock前link/unlink变化、双complete/双version、latest/final转移及所有必要写故障回滚。"
  ],
  "implementationAdmission": {
    "allowed": false,
    "scopeIfCorrected": "Only attachments/service.rs and attachments/store.rs necessary support; no F46 arithmetic/history rewrite, Database/HTTP/DTO/DDL/dependency/public-operation expansion.",
    "needsNewExactAddendum": true,
    "notG3": true
  },
